desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "Struct scan: Python shelve.open"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python shelve.open"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-python-shelve-open"
	risk: "deserialization"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 shelve.open。shelve 基于 pickle，不可信文件可导致代码执行。

### 风险类型
deserialization

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要打开不可信 shelve 文件。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://s.py": <<<POS
import shelve
def load(p):
    return shelve.open(p)

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def load(p):
    return p

NEG
)

shelve.open as $call
shelve.open(* as $p) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Python shelve.open",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python shelve.open",
	message: "结构扫描：Python shelve.open",
	risk: "deserialization",
}
